[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16800.39, "timestamp": "04:40:00", "text": "移动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16802.55, "timestamp": "04:40:02", "text": "呃，你正在点击这些东西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16804.47, "timestamp": "04:40:04", "text": "正确的？你知道，你只要放点什么就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16806.868, "timestamp": "04:40:06", "text": "在你的鼠标上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16810.15, "timestamp": "04:40:10", "text": "单击鼠标左键。好的。好的。好的。我的天啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16816.788, "timestamp": "04:40:16", "text": "真是太聪明了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16818.868, "timestamp": "04:40:18", "text": "正如你所看到的，更多的怪物正在生成。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16840.39, "timestamp": "04:40:40", "text": "有太多东西需要研磨。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16842.788, "timestamp": "04:40:42", "text": "还有一只狡猾的蜘蛛正在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16846.07, "timestamp": "04:40:46", "text": "向上。连蜘蛛都无法生存，别这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16849.59, "timestamp": "04:40:49", "text": "博。是的，我们还是会继续下滑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16857.03, "timestamp": "04:40:57", "text": "好的。"}]